{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:939c32df8a6e4fbd","name":"The Zann Consortium","source":{"id":"source:reference-939c32df8a6e4fbd","title":"The Zann Consortium","revision":23138,"timestamp":"2024-09-15T21:29:57Z","sha256":"753c5dc160d8c9cb3225f49a7820ed401e263155160105c7d400f4d74bad0142","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23138","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Zann%20Consortium&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-939c32df8a6e4fbd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Zann Consortium is a powerful criminal syndicate opposing both ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},". Run by the crime lord ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tyber Zann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tyber_Zann","referenceId":"reference:09c03e4646786993"},", the Consortium is his tool to take control of the galaxy's underworld and ultimately the galaxy. The Consortium's enemies include most major organizations in the galaxy, as well as criminal operations such as that of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Desilijic Kajidic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Desilijic_Kajidic?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Consortium's rise to power begins shortly after the destruction of the first Death Star and continues beyond the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},". Specialized Defilers excel at tasks such as corrupting officials, kidnapping, sabotage, and bribery.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Consortium features a sizeable military arm, which is able to field formidable space and ground forces. The Consortium's access to black-market weaponry and military devices of its own design gives it a great advantage over its enemies. What it cannot steal or otherwise obtain, it builds. Ships, armor, weaponry, equipment, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," are all within the Consortium's capabilities.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Zann Consortium Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Zann Consortium Defiler"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zann_Consortium_Defiler","referenceId":"reference:c9911abb3bc11d81"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Droideka Mark II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droideka_Mark_II","referenceId":"reference:de55cf35239b54ef"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\